msgctxt "140"
msgid "Ah, hello there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "You wouldn't happen to have any bones, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Pardon?"
msgstr "Prego?"

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Bones. The things you give to dogs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Do I look like I'm made of bones?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "212"
msgid "You must be mistaking us for another store."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Yeah, um... Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Hello. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr "Oh, salve. Cosa posso fare per te oggi?"

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Show me what you've got for sale."
msgstr "Fammi vedere che roba hai in vendita."

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Sure thing. We got a wide selection. See for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Thank you. Come again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I have something I'd like to sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Sure thing. Let's see what you got there. But don't forget, used weapons are"
" worth less than new weapons."
msgstr ""
"Certo. Vediamo un po' cosa c'hai lì. Ma non scordare, le armi usate valgono "
"meno di quelle nuove."

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Thank you. Come again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Nothing right now."
msgstr "Uh, niente al momento."

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Is that so? Well, please come again."
msgstr "Ah, è così? Beh, torni a trovarci."

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I'm here to buy."
msgstr "Sono qui per comprare."

msgctxt "392"
msgid "I'm here to sell."
msgstr "Sono qui per vendere."

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "Lascia stare."

